{title: HUMIDITY BUILT THE SNOWMAN}
{subtitle: John Prine}
Cancer surgery later in life caused John's voice to lower so he'd often perform a song in a different key than when he did when he was younger.  Both versions here are from live performances and you capo accordingly for either version.  In his earlier performance he does a reprise while in the later work he does not so you'll see a dashed line for each version.

